OL,3,GNEWSAArtists concerned AI use leads to
OL,4,Afewer commissions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndependent artists have said that
OL,7,Ffinding work in the era of AI "is a
OL,8,Fstruggle".
OL,10,FArtificial Intelligence has rippled
OL,11,Fthrough the creative industries, so
OL,12,FBerkshire-based Luke Crump and Emi
OL,13,FGiovanini have opened a month-long
OL,14,Fexhibition for people to enjoy their
OL,15,Fart free of charge.
OL,17,FGiovanini said that before AI she would
OL,18,Fget a lot of commissions for logos and
OL,19,Fflyers but that "since AI came all the
OL,20,Fpeople, especially with low budgets,
OL,21,Ftry [using AI]" instead, taking work
OL,22,Faway from local creatives.
